        "text": "top of page\nREAD DAN'S STORY ▶\nAfter choosing Pacifica as the place to call home, Dan Urban is dedicated to protecting what makes it special while bringing practical leadership and fresh ideas to help the community thrive.\n## Meet Dan\n# Dan Urban\nFOR PACIFICA CITY COUNCIL\nDonate\nVolunteer\n# DAN URBAN FOR COUNCIL\nRespect the past. Lead the future.\n##### Building Community\nSupporting local businesses, creating a destination city, and making Pacifica a place where families and public servants can afford to live.\n## Our Priorities\nThoughtful growth while respecting our coastline, neighborhoods, trails, and quality of life.\n##### Protecting Pacifica\n##### Fiscal Stewardship\nMake every tax dollar count and create revenue streams.\nbottom of page",
